   "title": "\u2139\ufe0f Version cache \u2014 how it works",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Version cache\n\nA local history of the graph, independent of git.\n\n### BD_WorkflowVersionCache\nSnapshots the graph when it changes. `workflow_id` names the history \u2014 keep it\nstable per project. `max_versions` trims oldest. `save_on_any_change` snapshots\nevery edit; turn it off and drive `trigger` yourself.\n\n### BD_WorkflowVersionList\nPrints the history. Set `compare_version_a` / `compare_version_b` for a diff of\nwhich nodes were added or removed between two snapshots.\n\n### BD_WorkflowVersionRestore\nReturns a chosen version as JSON, and with `save_to_file` writes it out so you can\nload it. **Does not** hot-swap the running graph.\n\n### BD_WorkflowVersionClear\nDeletes history. `confirm_clear` must be **true** or it no-ops \u2014 and it ships\n**false** here so loading this template cannot wipe a real history.\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f ComfyUI skips a node whose inputs are unchanged, so a node whose job is a\n> **side effect** can silently not run. If a snapshot or file seems missing, change\n> an input to force execution."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
