   "widgets_values": [
    "`draw_graph` **always** draws the workflow. A connected `image` is composited over\nit at `image_blend`:\n\n* `1.0` image only\n* `0.15` (here) graph reads clearly, image is a wash\n* `0.0` graph only \u2014 same as leaving `image` disconnected\n\nEarlier the image won outright, so wiring a LoadImage silently removed the graph\nfrom the card that was documenting it."
